                  "text": "Your PTO balance cannot go negative. You can only take PTO you have already accrued. If your request is longer than your available balance, you can reduce the request, or request unpaid personal leave for the remainder (RSE-LV-01 \u00a76).\nThe HR Portal will not let you submit a request that takes your balance below zero. Managers cannot approve PTO that hasn't accrued yet, and Ridgeline does not advance PTO from future pay periods. If you are short of PTO for an important reason, talk to your manager and HR early; unpaid personal leave is approved by HR.",
